raw_content:
DTOs done. Now the ConnectionService — the biggest file. I'll write it in 3 parts. Let me carefully draft.

Part 1: package, imports, class decl, fields, constructor, register().
Part 2: cancel(), getConnection(), listPlanConnections(), listRisks(), diagnose(), listDecisions().
Part 3: batchGuaranteeReschedule(), recomputeAfterReschedule(), private helpers.

Key details:

- OPERATION_ZONE = PlanService.OPERATION_ZONE (public static).
- helpers: maxEnd(occupancies), minStart(occupancies), occupancyWithMaxEnd, occupancyWithMinStart.
- floorDiv for minutes: Math.floorDiv(diffMillis, 60000L).
- Idempotency helpers duplicated: sha256, toJson, fromJson, replayIfPresent, conflict/badRequest/notFound/unprocessable.

Register flow (detailed above). Note replay for ConnectionView.

For register, need to build ConnectionView from a fresh RailConnection + plans: toView(conn, pred, succ).

toView(RailConnection conn): load plans by id; if ACTIVE compute evaluation else nulls.

Cancel: hash = sha256("CONNECTION_CANCEL\n" + connectionKey). Replay generic ConnectionView.

getConnection: findByKey else 404 CONNECTION_NOT_FOUND; toView.

listPlanConnections: plan = findByKey else 404 PLAN_NOT_FOUND; findAllByPlan → map to ConnectionListItem(role, toView).

listRisks: plan exists else 404; findRisksBySuccessor → map to view (need connectionKey + scheduleKeys: load connection by id, plans by id).

diagnose: plan exists else 404; state = findState (default NONE); active connections via findActiveByPredecessor + findActiveBySuccessor; for each compute evaluation: required = arrival + guarantee; actual = departure; slack = floorDiv(actual-required). role PREDECESSOR/SUCCESSOR, otherScheduleKey.

listDecisions: plan exists else 404; findDecisionsBySuccessor → views.

batchGuaranteeReschedule: as designed. Items validated: shiftMinutes 1..1440 else 422 INVALID_SHIFT_MINUTES. Distinct scheduleKeys else 400.

Inside tx:
```
planRepo.acquirePublishLock();
long nowMillis = clock.millis();
Instant now = clock.instant();
record PlanShift(DayPlan plan, Long riskConnectionId, List<Occupancy> current, List<Occupancy> shifted, int shiftMinutes) {}
List<PlanShift> shifts = new ArrayList<>();
Set<String> seen...
for (item : req.items()) {
    DayPlan plan = planRepo.findByKeyForUpdate(item.scheduleKey()).orElseThrow(notFound);
    if (plan.status() != PUBLISHED) throw conflict PLAN_STATE_CONFLICT
    PlanConnectionState state = connRepo.findState(plan.id()).orElse(null);
    if (state == null || state.riskStatus() != CONNECTION_AT_RISK) throw conflict("CONNECTION_NOT_AT_RISK", ...)
    List<Occupancy> occ = planRepo.findOccupancies(plan.id());
    Instant departure = minStart(occ);
    if (!departure.isAfter(now)) throw 422 PLAN_ALREADY_STARTED details {departureUtc, nowUtc}
    List<Occupancy> shifted = occ.stream().map(o -> new Occupancy(o.id(), o.planId(), o.seq(), o.trainNo(), o.sectionId(), o.startUtc().plusMillis(shift*60000L), o.endUtc().plusMillis(...))).toList();
    // within op day
    Instant dayStart = plan.opDate().atStartOfDay(ZONE).toInstant(); dayEnd = plusDays(1)
    for (o : shifted) if (o.startUtc().isBefore(dayStart) || o.endUtc().isAfter(dayEnd)) throw 422 SHIFT_OUT_OF_OPERATION_DAY details {scheduleKey, shiftMinutes, opDate, dayEndUtc}
    shifts.add(...)
}
// slot conflicts vs other published plans
List<Long> batchIds = shifts.stream().map(s -> s.plan().id()).toList();
List<Map<String,Object>> conflicts = new ArrayList<>();
for (s : shifts) conflicts.addAll(slotChecker.findSectionConflicts(s.plan(), s.shifted(), batchIds));
// pairwise among batch
for i<j: for o1 in shifted_i, o2 in shifted_j: same section && overlap → detail {type SECTION_CONFLICT, sectionId, scheduleKey_i, conflictingScheduleKey_j,...}
if (!conflicts.isEmpty()) throw 422 SLOT_CONFLICT details
// connection checks on final state
Map<Long, List<Occupancy>> finalOcc = batchIds → shifted
for (s : shifts) {
    for (conn : connRepo.findActiveBySuccessor(s.plan().id())) {
        Instant predArrival = arrivalOf(conn.predecessorPlanId(), finalOcc);
        Instant required = predArrival.plus(guarantee, MINUTES);
        Instant actual = minStart(s.shifted());
        if (actual.isBefore(required)) throw 422 GUARANTEE_NOT_MET details {connectionKey, requiredDepartureUtc, actualDepartureUtc, shortfallMinutes}
    }
    for (conn : connRepo.findActiveByPredecessor(s.plan().id())) {
        Instant newArrival = maxEnd(s.shifted());
        Instant succDeparture = departureOf(conn.successorPlanId(), finalOcc);
        Instant required = newArrival.plus(guarantee, MINUTES);
        if (succDeparture.isBefore(required)) throw 422 GUARANTEE_NOT_MET details
    }
}
// apply
List<ItemResult> results = new ArrayList<>();
for (s : shifts) {
    planRepo.replaceOccupancies(s.plan().id(), shifted as new Occupancy(0, planId, seq,...));
    planRepo.updateVersionAndStatus(s.plan().id(), s.plan().version()+1, PUBLISHED, nowMillis);
    connRepo.upsertState(s.plan().id(), NONE, null, nowMillis);
    // decision record
    if (s.riskConnectionId() != null) {
        connOpt = connRepo.findById(s.riskConnectionId());
        if (present && status == ACTIVE) {
            conn = ...; pred = planRepo.findById(conn.predecessorPlanId());
            predArrival = arrivalOf(conn.predecessorPlanId(), finalOcc)  // predecessor could also be in batch
            shortfallBefore = conn.guaranteeMinutes() - floorDiv(oldDeparture - predArrival)
            connRepo.insertDecision(new GuaranteeDecision(0, req.requestKey(), conn.id(), conn.predecessorPlanId(), s.plan().id(), pred.version(), oldDeparture, newDeparture, shift, shortfallBefore, nowMillis));
        }
    }
    results.add(new ItemResult(key, oldDeparture, newDeparture, shift, version+1));
}
GuaranteeRescheduleResponse response = new GuaranteeRescheduleResponse(results);
idemRepo.insert(OP_GUARANTEE_RESCHEDULE, req.requestKey(), hash, toJson(response), nowMillis);
return response;
```

arrivalOf/departureOf helpers: if planId in finalOcc map use those else planRepo.findOccupancies.

Note: oldDeparture for decision = minStart(s.current()).

